-- The reference instance: one small lineup in this project's schema, applied
-- after the migrations by `TestApp::new()` and `tests/golden.rs`.
--
-- Hand-maintained. Every host is `*.example`, every stream path is
-- `/live/fixtureuser/fixturepass/<id>`, every name is an invented word, and
-- the password hash is a fixture's;
-- `the_sample_instance_references_no_host_outside_the_allowlist` checks the
-- first two on every run.
--
-- Twelve channels across four groups, with the shapes a lineup has: two
-- channels sharing one guide, a three-stream failover chain, a stream no
-- channel plays, channels with no guide data at all. Ids from 900 are the
-- hard cases the snapshots in fixtures/golden/ depend on; the section at the
-- end lists each and says why it is here.
--
-- The administrator is `fixtureadmin` / `ipx-test-password`, with
-- `custom_properties.xc_password` = `fixturepass` for the Xtream API.


